  <acqinfo id="e11ba0c1ed88054d603a3b08c35e8a34">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Commonwealth Fund records were donated to RAC in 1985. The initial transfer of archival records to RAC began in 1986, and transfers continue on a regular basis. This series was transferred to RAC as accession 2007:077.</p>  </acqinfo>
  <scopecontent id="dbad7b927219e98d3f50cf15f23e1426">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This series contains Executive Vice President for Programs, Stephen Schoenbaum's files of the Program Monitoring Advisory Committee Meetings, 1995-2003. Each meeting book provides the agenda and discussions, committee members and participants, budget plan, goals, program overviews and reports, and Fund quarterly reports.</p>  </scopecontent>
